NOTE ON SOURCE MATERIAL

This repository distils the pedagogical content of "Writing in the Sciences"
(Kristin Sainani, Stanford University) into machine-actionable instructions. The
MIT licence above covers the code and the original prose in this repository.

It does not cover, and this repository does not redistribute, the course itself:
its videos, slides, transcripts, exercises or assessments. Short excerpts are
quoted for educational commentary and attributed to their module. Copyright in
the course remains with Stanford University and the course author.

This project is independent and unaffiliated. If you represent Stanford
University or the course author and would like any excerpt removed or reworded,
open an issue and it will be addressed promptly.
